<title>USA: Egypt adds 116,500 tonnes wheat to purchases-USDA.</title>
<headline>Egypt adds 116,500 tonnes wheat to purchases-USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Egypt added 116,500 tonnes to its purchases of U.S. wheat in the week ending May 22, the Agriculture Department said on Friday.</p>
<p>In its weekly export sales report, USDA said Egypt bought 556,500 tonnes of wheat in the week ending May 22. Exporters had reported sales of 450,000 tonnes under the daily reporting system.</p>
</text>
